<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Hello&nbsp;{!Contact.FirstName}</font><span style="font-family: arial;">,</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: arial;"><br></span></div><div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">We have received your request to switch your major and the change has been completed. You can view this update on <a href="http://my.asu.edu">My ASU</a>&nbsp;under <b>My Programs and eAdvisor</b>.&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial">While you are in My ASU, please be sure to check for any missing items you may need to complete your file. We will be able to review your file once you have completed your application file.&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">If you have any questions, please contact me at&nbsp;</font><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">{!Case.Opportunity_Owner_s_Recruiter_Email__c}</span></div><div><font face="arial">. I am your personal&nbsp;contact for admission-related questions, and I’ll be happy to help you through the admission process.</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Sincerely,</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-size: medium; font-family: Times;"><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="arial">{!Case.Opportunity_Owner_s_Full_Name__c}</font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="arial">{!Case.Opportunity_Owner_s_Title__c}</font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="arial">Admission Services</font></div><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="arial">{!Case.Opportunity_Owner_s_Recruiter_Email__c}</font></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="arial">{!Case.Opportunity_Owner_s_Pone__c}</font></div></div></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div><div><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.</font></div><div><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>